        "message": "invalid_grant: TOKMARK7f3a-xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx<script>"
      },
      "note": "error_description cut to \u2264128 printable ASCII (jerk-oauth: 120); non-printable and non-ASCII dropped. the message keeps only printable ASCII and is cut to 120 characters (\"invalid_grant: \" + description)."
